msgid "These OpenWrt settings override the corresponding values in pref.toml. Options not shown here remain managed by pref.toml. Restart the service after changing runtime settings."
msgstr "这些 OpenWrt 设置会覆盖 pref.toml 中的对应值。未在本页显示的选项仍由 pref.toml 管理。修改运行设置后请重启服务。"

